        "content": "type: event_result\nid: \"2002496392616\"\nprovider: eventbrite\ntitle: Yoga for Grounding\ndescription: \"Through mindful sequencing, we build heat and energy in the body with breath-led movement, then pause to hold selected postures, creating space to explore alignment, stillness, and deeper breathing. The practice balances effort and ease, inviting both strength and softness - so you leave feeling energised, centred, and more connected to your breath. Open to all levels and beginner-friendly. This class is held in English. The Art.OM studio is located on the ground floor, just to the left in the hallway when you enter the building. You can bring your own mat or use one of ours. Please arrive 10 minutes early to settle in. The door will be closed once class begins, and late entry will not be possible.\"\nurl: \"https://www.eventbrite.de/e/yoga-for-grounding-tickets-2002496392616\"\ndate_start: \"2026-10-14T18:00:00\"\ndate_end: \"2026-10-14T19:00:00\"\ntimezone: Europe/Berlin\nevent_type: PHYSICAL\nvenue_name: Wrangelstraße 54\nvenue_address: \"Wrangelstraße 54, 10997 Berlin\"\nvenue_city: Berlin\nvenue_state: BE\nvenue_country: DE\nvenue_lat: 52.49828330000001\nvenue_lon: 13.4424341\norganizer_name: Art OM\norganizer_url: \"https://www.eventbrite.de/o/art-om-113675772011\"\norganizer_summary: \"Art.OM is your welcoming local space for artistic exploration and body alignment, located in vibrant Kreuzberg – Wrangelstr. 54.We bring together yoga and art to create a space for growth, reflection,...\"\norganizer_followers: 92\nis_paid: true\nfee_min: \"11.83\"\nfee_max: \"22.49\"\nfee_currency: EUR\nfee_display: 11.83 EUR - 22.49 EUR\nimage_url: \"https://img.evbuc.com/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.evbuc.com%2Fimages%2F1185517963%2F2833591895431%2F1%2Foriginal.20260527-124333?crop=focalpoint&fit=crop&w=300&auto=format%2Ccompress&q=75&sharp=10&fp-x=0.5&fp-y=0.5&s=0e15d1dc6c29004f6f649af94c344740\"\nticket_info_tickets_by: Eventbrite\nticket_info_tickets_url: \"https://www.eventbrite.com/checkout-external?eid=2002496392616\"\nticket_info_has_available_tickets: true\nticket_info_is_sold_out: false\nticket_info_sales_status: on_sale\ntags: \"Yoga|Health & Wellness|Class, Training, or Workshop|Yoga|Mindfulness|Flow|Movement|Vinyasa|Hathayoga\"\neventbrite_event_id: \"2002496392616\"\nhash: 1e103583ff3d7072\nembed_ref: yoga-for-grounding-TB2\napp_id: events\nskill_id: search",
