        "type": "event",
        "content": "type: event_result\nid: \"316882262\"\nprovider: meetup\ntitle: \"Mobility Yoga :) Optional Bouldering after \"\ndescription: \"Spot needs to be booked [here via this link 🌻](https://gyms.vertical-life.info/urban-apes-fhain/events/9058/list) (not via meetup!)\\n\\nYou‘re new to Berlin or already here for a while and want to practice yoga with others in a relaxed atmosphere?\\n\\nOr looking to explore a cool place to get to know new people and have the option to go bouldering or hangout after the class for a drink?\\n\\nThis all-levels yoga class is happening every two weeks at the Bouldering Gym Urban Apes Friedrichshain. We flow together through some yoga, practice specific mobility exercises and after the class you could decide to try out bouldering in the gym. :)\\n\\nNo yoga or climbing experience needed! No flexibility needed! Just come as you are.\\n\\nPoses and Flows are explained and we flow in a relaxed pace, leaving room for play, mistakes, learning and joy :-)\\n\\nAlso a good way to practice English and connect to people with different backgrounds.\\n\\n**Important:**\\nThe yoga class is 5€ (Booking via the Link, NOT via Meetup). If you want to go Bouldering too, you can check in via USC and Wellpass for free or have to pay the regular entrance fee. But of course you can also only come for the yoga class and not pay the bouldering entry :) Class starts 19pm sharp - arrive 15 min before the class starts, so you have enough time to check in and change.\\nMats and blankets at the Gym.\\n\\n[Book your spot via this link 🌻](https://gyms.vertical-life.info/urban-apes-fhain/events/9058/list)\\n\\nHow to find the Room:\\nFirst go to the counter. From there go right. Yoga Room is next to the Womens Changing Room. If you can’t find it, ask at the counter.\\n\\n(Little tipp: take a screenshot of this for later)\"\nurl: \"https://www.meetup.com/mobility-yoga-with-optional-bouldering-to-connect-after/events/316882262/\"\ndate_start: \"2026-10-13T19:00:00+02:00\"\ndate_end: \"2026-10-13T19:45:00+02:00\"\ntimezone: Europe/Berlin\nevent_type: PHYSICAL\nvenue_name: Urban Apes Friedrichshain\nvenue_address: Friedensstraße 91 B\nvenue_city: Berlin\nvenue_state: \"\"\nvenue_country: DE\nvenue_lat: 52.522205\nvenue_lon: 13.436905\norganizer_id: \"38554467\"\norganizer_name: Mobility Yoga - optional bouldering after\norganizer_slug: mobility-yoga-with-optional-bouldering-to-connect-after\nrsvp_count: 1\nis_paid: false\nfee: null\nimage_url: \"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/d/b/0/highres_534743984.jpeg\"\nhash: b2c08e896f336dfa\nembed_ref: mobility-yoga-optional-qv3\napp_id: events\nskill_id: search",
