        "content": "type: event_result\nid: \"316697938\"\nprovider: meetup\ntitle: \"Vinyasa Flow in Mitte / Wedding \"\ndescription: \"These vinyasa classes are positively dynamic, soft and strong as silk, always connecting to the deep, guiding you gently to the awareness of your breath to calm the mind and release the body of unnecessary tension.\\nModifications of the poses are offered to better suit each practitioner, from experienced beginners to advanced. Taping into a background of cultural diversity, dance and massage therapy, these sessions are a holistic practice with asanas, free form movement, music, voice, and silence.\\n\\nEach month the classes have a specific focus (i.e. twists, balance, resilience, chakras) to effectively process and develop the connection between mind, body, and spirit.\\n\\n**deutsch**\\n\\nVinyasa Yoga ist gezeichnet durch fließende Bewegungen und Sequenzen von Asanas die bewusst in Verbindung mit der Atmung stehen. Die Mittwochabend Klassen sind sanft kräftigend, dynamisch & schweißtreibend mit dem Ziel von Regeneration & Revitalisierung. Die Praxis besteht aus Asana-Praxis, freie Bewegung, Atmungsübungen, Meditation und Entspannung. Es werden sowohl einfache als auch fortgeschrittene Varianten der Asanas angeboten, um deine Praxis an dein Level anzupassen.\\n\\nJeden Monat zielt der Kurs auf einen spezifischen Fokus hin (z.B. Rückbeugen, Gleichgewicht, Umkehrhaltungen) um körperliche Fortschritte zu erleichtern und Raum im Geist zu schöpfen.\\n\\nABOUT MARIANNE:\\n\\nMarianne Schmidt, born to german parents in India, raised across the globe, she calls Berlin home. She is the founder of Soul Treats and works as a certified massage therapist, yoga instructor and life coach.\\n\\nMarianne has been offering yoga classes and massage therapy for over eleven years. Fascinated by human anatomy and the connection between the psyche and the physical, her education is an ongoing process. Taping into many methods of body work, she treats clients and students holistically, by aligning the physical body with the aim of restoring balance on the emotional and energetical levels.\\n\\nDancing and performing since a yoga age, her yoga classes always include elements of dance, movement research and breath work.\\n\\nBreath is a her guide, \\\"dancing from sound to silence, flowing from silence to sound.\\\"\\n\\nPreis:\\n\\nErste Stunde - 10 Euro\\nStarterpaket: 3 Stunden - 20 Euro (gültig für 1 Monat, in alle Soul Treats Kurse möglich)\"\nurl: \"https://www.meetup.com/berlin-yoga-club/events/316697938/\"\ndate_start: \"2026-10-14T19:30:00+02:00\"\ndate_end: \"2026-10-14T21:00:00+02:00\"\ntimezone: Europe/Berlin\nevent_type: PHYSICAL\nvenue_name: YOGA at Lobe Block UG\nvenue_address: Böttgerstraße 16\nvenue_city: Berlin\nvenue_state: BE\nvenue_country: de\nvenue_lat: 52.548916\nvenue_lon: 13.381006\norganizer_id: \"22903338\"\norganizer_name: Berlin Yoga Club\norganizer_slug: Berlin-Yoga-Club\nrsvp_count: 1\nis_paid: false\nfee: null\nimage_url: \"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/d/8/f/highres_487544431.jpeg\"\nhash: a3a3a32f18913dff\nembed_ref: vinyasa-flow-in-a8l\napp_id: events\nskill_id: search",
